# RFC-TM-5 §4 (rfc-tm-5-diamond.md), S-EDITOR-1 — one line per entity sigil
# (`->`, `@`, `::`, `<:`, `#:`, `!`, `%`, `~`, `&`, `&!`, `$env`, `$config`,
# `^`), each with a name immediately before the sigil, so the smoke test can
# assert both the name token and the sigil token carry scopes beyond
# source.typedmind (the historical ClassFile failure mode: a highlighted
# operator next to an unhighlighted name). The grammar
# (syntaxes/typedmind.tmLanguage.json) has no longform-block tokenization
# (`program X { ... }` etc. fall through as plain source.typedmind text — see
# vsix-packaging.test.ts's sibling textmate-drift-smoke.test.ts header for the
# scope note); every sigil this doc names is a shortform-only operator, so
# this fixture is shortform-only by construction.

ProgramEntity -> mainFn v1.0.0
FileEntity @ src/file.ts:
FunctionEntity :: (input: string) => void
ClassEntity <: BaseClass
ClassFileEntity #: src/class-file.ts <: BaseClass
ConstantsEntity ! src/config.ts : ConfigSchema
DtoEntity %
AssetEntity ~ "asset description"
UiComponentEntity & "component description"
RootUiComponentEntity &! "root component description"
ENV_PARAM $env "environment parameter" (required)
CONFIG_PARAM $config "config parameter"
dependency-entity ^ "dependency purpose" v1.0.0
